WEBVTT

00:15:27.641 --> 00:15:31.013
and how he's never, ever going to give up.

00:15:31.013 --> 00:15:33.243
And the third thing I 
want to leave you with:

00:15:33.243 --> 00:15:36.759
If you ever come across a situation

00:15:36.759 --> 00:15:39.898
that you see as so unacceptable,

00:15:39.898 --> 00:15:43.621
I want you to dig down as deep as you can

00:15:43.621 --> 00:15:46.476
and find your best mother bear

00:15:46.476 --> 00:15:48.885
and go after it.

00:15:48.885 --> 00:15:54.438
(Applause)